    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tilebound</strong> is a captivating blend of strategy, puzzle-solving, and magical combat, where every tile you place shapes your destiny. You are a novice Tile Wizard, bound to an ancient spellbook, seeking freedom by mastering the art of building powerful tile chains and unleashing elemental spells.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Tile Placement</strong><br>Begin your journey with a single enchanted tile and unlock new ones as you progress through the levels. Each tile carries unique elemental properties\u2014allowing you to create intricate chains that trigger devastating spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442720/extras/33b9649b5af1c3e0a144ed1f9e092322.poster.avif?t=1753889634\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442720/extras/33b9649b5af1c3e0a144ed1f9e092322.webm?t=1753889634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442720/extras/33b9649b5af1c3e0a144ed1f9e092322.mp4?t=1753889634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Spellcasting System</strong><br>Align your tiles to match rune shapes hidden within each level. The longer your chain and the more precise your patterns, the more powerful your spells become, rewarding you with rare tiles and magical artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Challenges</strong><br>Face an array of progressively complex levels, each introducing new mechanics and environmental hazards. Every level tests your mastery of the spellbook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom Through Mastery</strong><br>Every chain you build brings you closer to unlocking the full potential of your spellbook. Can you master the art of tile magic and break free from the book's bindings?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you ready to place your first tile and begin the journey to freedom?</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tilebound</strong> is a captivating blend of strategy, puzzle-solving, and magical combat, where every tile you place shapes your destiny. You are a novice Tile Wizard, bound to an ancient spellbook, seeking freedom by mastering the art of building powerful tile chains and unleashing elemental spells.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Tile Placement</strong><br>Begin your journey with a single enchanted tile and unlock new ones as you progress through the levels. Each tile carries unique elemental properties\u2014allowing you to create intricate chains that trigger devastating spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442720/extras/33b9649b5af1c3e0a144ed1f9e092322.poster.avif?t=1753889634\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442720/extras/33b9649b5af1c3e0a144ed1f9e092322.webm?t=1753889634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442720/extras/33b9649b5af1c3e0a144ed1f9e092322.mp4?t=1753889634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Spellcasting System</strong><br>Align your tiles to match rune shapes hidden within each level. The longer your chain and the more precise your patterns, the more powerful your spells become, rewarding you with rare tiles and magical artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Challenges</strong><br>Face an array of progressively complex levels, each introducing new mechanics and environmental hazards. Every level tests your mastery of the spellbook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom Through Mastery</strong><br>Every chain you build brings you closer to unlocking the full potential of your spellbook. Can you master the art of tile magic and break free from the book's bindings?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you ready to place your first tile and begin the journey to freedom?</h2>",
    "short_description": "Master the art of tile magic in Tilebound, a spellbinding blend of strategy, puzzles, and magical combat. Build powerful tile chains, unleash elemental spells, and conquer evolving challenges in a vibrant, hand-drawn 2D world. Can you unlock the secrets of the spellbook and break free?",
